From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:19:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] windows.storage: Implement StorageFile.GetFileFromPathAsync.

A StorageFile for a full path to an existing file, with its name, path, file type, attributes,
creation date and IsOfType; the other methods are stubs that log their calls. The operation
fails with the error of the file lookup, and with E_INVALIDARG for a relative path or a
directory. Minecraft Bedrock imports a skin this way after the Windows App SDK file picker:
GetFileFromPathAsync, then Name and Path.

Original work for macrock (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Topic: storage-file
